[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: The scribe daemon never reloads Python

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @repo

[WORK]
UID: WORK-DAEMON-NO-HOT-RELOAD
TITLE: The scribe daemon never reloads Python
DEPTH: sketch
AUTHORED_BY: llm
STATEMENT: >>>
The scribe daemon never reloads Python modules. An import-level change under
dev/scripts/ breaks every scribe call with a JSON-RPC -32002 raised out of
strictdoc_config.py, and the failure does not name the cause. The only
recovery today is `devenv processes restart scribe`, which a session has to
already know about. Cheapest fix: a file watcher on dev/scripts that restarts
the worker, or a `scribe restart` verb that does it on demand.
<<<
